      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a very common feeling to feel like a ghost in a busy place, but please remember that your presence matters even when you feel invisible. You are not a ghost; you are a person with a story, a mind, and a capacity to feel deeply, which makes you irreplaceable. When you feel this way, it is often because you are carrying a heavy burden, and you do not have to carry it alone.",
